meta {
  name: Download Import Template
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/api/admin/usulan/import/template
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "tipe": "Penelitian"
  }
}

docs {
  # POST /api/admin/usulan/import/template

  Download template Excel untuk import bulk usulan. Isi template sesuai format, lalu upload ke endpoint import.

  ## Request Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | tipe | string | ✅ | Tipe usulan: `Penelitian` atau `Pengabdian` |

  ## Response Success (200)

  File download binary (.xlsx):
  ```
  Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet
  Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="template-import-usulan.xlsx"
  ```

  ## Error Responses

  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|
  | 400 | Validasi gagal |
  | 401 | Tidak terautentikasi |
  | 403 | Tidak memiliki permission manage_penelitian atau manage_pengabdian |
}
